      "reason": "SUNLU's unit column names both scales (\"HA/HD\") and the row does not say which, so the value is recorded in the unit the register keeps for exactly this case (V000420, V002456). The missing scale is the sheet's, and this finding is the right record of it: the number is kept and compared with nothing.",
